          "zh": "共同部分只算一次。并集是 12 + 12 − 6 = 18，交并比是 6 ÷ 18，约 33%。",
          "en": "Count the shared part only once. The union is 12 + 12 − 6 = 18. IoU is 6 ÷ 18, about 33%."
        },
